#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Configuring the Makefile for FreeBSD Ports"
msgstr "配置 FreeBSD Ports 的 Makefile"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Chapter 5. Configuring the Makefile"
msgstr "第 5 章　配置 Makefile"

#. type: Title =
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:14
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Configuring the Makefile"
msgstr "配置 Makefile"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:54
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Configuring the [.filename]#Makefile# is pretty simple, and again we suggest "
"looking at existing examples before starting.  Also, there is a crossref:"
"porting-samplem[porting-samplem,sample Makefile] in this handbook, so take a "
"look and please follow the ordering of variables and sections in that "
"template to make the port easier for others to read."
msgstr "配置 [.filename]#Makefile# 非常简单；同样，我们建议先查看现有示例再开始。本手册中还有一个 crossref:porting-samplem[porting-samplem,示例 Makefile]，请参考该示例，并遵循模板中变量和章节的排列顺序，以便其他人更容易阅读这个 port。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:56
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Consider these problems in sequence during the design of the new [."
"filename]#Makefile#:"
msgstr "设计新的 [.filename]#Makefile# 时，请依次考虑以下问题："

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:58
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The Original Source"
msgstr "原始源代码"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:62
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Does it live in `DISTDIR` as a standard ``gzip``ped tarball named something "
"like [.filename]#foozolix-1.2.tar.gz#? If so, go on to the next step.  If "
"not, the distribution file format might require overriding one or more of "
"`DISTVERSION`, `DISTNAME`, `EXTRACT_CMD`, `EXTRACT_BEFORE_ARGS`, "
"`EXTRACT_AFTER_ARGS`, `EXTRACT_SUFX`, or `DISTFILES`."
msgstr "它是否位于 `DISTDIR` 中，是一个标准的 ``gzip`` 压缩 tarball，文件名类似 [.filename]#foozolix-1.2.tar.gz#？如果是，请继续下一步。如果不是，可能需要覆盖 `DISTVERSION`、`DISTNAME`、`EXTRACT_CMD`、`EXTRACT_BEFORE_ARGS`、`EXTRACT_AFTER_ARGS`、`EXTRACT_SUFX` 或 `DISTFILES` 中的一个或多个变量，以适配发行文件格式。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:65
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the worst case, create a custom `do-extract` target to override the "
"default.  This is rarely, if ever, necessary."
msgstr "最糟的情况下，可以创建自定义 `do-extract` 目标来覆盖默认行为。这种情况极少发生，甚至可能从未发生过。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:67
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Naming"
msgstr "命名"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:70
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The first part of the port's [.filename]#Makefile# names the port, describes "
"its version number, and lists it in the correct category."
msgstr "port 的 [.filename]#Makefile# 开头部分用于命名 port、说明其版本号，并将其列入正确的类别。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:72
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`PORTNAME`"
msgstr "`PORTNAME`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:76
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Set `PORTNAME` to the base name of the software.  It is used as the base for "
"the FreeBSD package, and for crossref:makefiles[makefile-distname,"
"`DISTNAME`]."
msgstr "将 `PORTNAME` 设置为软件的基本名称。它既是 FreeBSD 软件包名称的基础，也是 crossref:makefiles[makefile-distname,`DISTNAME`] 的基础。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:83
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The package name must be unique across the entire ports tree.  Make sure "
"that the `PORTNAME` is not already in use by an existing port, and that no "
"other port already has the same `PKGBASE`.  If the name has already been "
"used, add either crossref:makefiles[porting-pkgnameprefix-suffix,"
"`PKGNAMEPREFIX` or `PKGNAMESUFFIX`]."
msgstr "软件包名称在整个 ports 树中必须唯一。请确保 `PORTNAME` 尚未被现有 port 使用，并且没有其他 port 使用相同的 `PKGBASE`。如果该名称已被使用，请添加 crossref:makefiles[porting-pkgnameprefix-suffix,`PKGNAMEPREFIX` 或 `PKGNAMESUFFIX`]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:86
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Versions, `DISTVERSION` _or_ `PORTVERSION`"
msgstr "版本：`DISTVERSION` __或__ `PORTVERSION`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:89
#, fuzzy
msgid "Set `DISTVERSION` to the version number of the software."
msgstr "将 `DISTVERSION` 设置为软件的版本号。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:93
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`PORTVERSION` is the version used for the FreeBSD package.  It will be "
"automatically derived from `DISTVERSION` to be compatible with FreeBSD's "
"package versioning scheme.  If the version contains _letters_, it might be "
"needed to set `PORTVERSION` and not `DISTVERSION`."
msgstr "`PORTVERSION` 是 FreeBSD 软件包使用的版本。它会根据 `DISTVERSION` 自动生成，以兼容 FreeBSD 的软件包版本方案。如果版本中包含__字母__，可能需要设置 `PORTVERSION` 而不是 `DISTVERSION`。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:97
#, fuzzy
msgid "Only one of `PORTVERSION` and `DISTVERSION` can be set at a time."
msgstr "`PORTVERSION` 和 `DISTVERSION` 一次只能设置一个。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:100
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"From time to time, some software will use a version scheme that is not "
"compatible with how `DISTVERSION` translates in `PORTVERSION`."
msgstr "有时，某些软件使用的版本方案与 `DISTVERSION` 转换为 `PORTVERSION` 的方式不兼容。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:105
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When updating a port, it is possible to use the `-t` argument of man:pkg-"
"version[8] to check if the new version is greater or lesser than before.  "
"See below on how to use man:pkg-version[8] to compare versions."
msgstr "更新 port 时，可以使用 man:pkg-version[8] 的 `-t` 参数检查新版本是大于还是小于旧版本。有关如何使用 man:pkg-version[8] 比较版本，请参见下文。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:108
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using man:pkg-version[8] to Compare Versions"
msgstr "使用 man:pkg-version[8] 比较版本"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:112
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`pkg version -t` takes two versions as arguments, it will respond with `<`, "
"`=` or `>` if the first version is less, equal, or more than the second "
"version, respectively."
msgstr "`pkg version -t` 接受两个版本作为参数。如果第一个版本小于、等于或大于第二个版本，它分别会输出 `<`、`=` 或 `>`。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:127
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% pkg version -t 1.2 1.3\n"
" < <.>\n"
"% pkg version -t 1.2 1.2\n"
" = <.>\n"
"% pkg version -t 1.2 1.2.0\n"
" = <.>\n"
"% pkg version -t 1.2 1.2.p1\n"
" > <.>\n"
"% pkg version -t 1.2.a1 1.2.b1\n"
" < <.>\n"
"% pkg version -t 1.2 1.2p1\n"
" < <.>\n"
msgstr "% pkg version -t 1.2 1.3\n < <.>\n% pkg version -t 1.2 1.2\n = <.>\n% pkg version -t 1.2 1.2.0\n = <.>\n% pkg version -t 1.2 1.2.p1\n > <.>\n% pkg version -t 1.2.a1 1.2.b1\n < <.>\n% pkg version -t 1.2 1.2p1\n < <.>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:130
#, fuzzy
msgid "`1.2` is before `1.3`."
msgstr "`1.2` 早于 `1.3`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:131
#, fuzzy
msgid "`1.2` and `1.2` are equal as they have the same version."
msgstr "`1.2` 和 `1.2` 相等，因为它们的版本相同。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:132
#, fuzzy
msgid "`1.2` and `1.2.0` are equal as nothing equals zero."
msgstr "`1.2` 和 `1.2.0` 相等，因为末尾的零不改变数值。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:133
#, fuzzy
msgid "`1.2` is after `1.2.p1` as `.p1`, think \"pre-release 1\"."
msgstr "`1.2` 晚于 `1.2.p1`，因为 `.p1` 可理解为“预发布版 1”。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:134
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`1.2.a1` is before `1.2.b1`, think \"alpha\" and \"beta\", and `a` is before "
"`b`."
msgstr "`1.2.a1` 早于 `1.2.b1`，可将它们理解为“alpha”和“beta”；`a` 排在 `b` 之前。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:135
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`1.2` is before `1.2p1` as `2p1`, think \"2, patch level 1\" which is a "
"version after any `2.X` but before `3`."
msgstr "`1.2` 早于 `1.2p1`，因为 `2p1` 可理解为“2，补丁级别 1”，其版本高于任何 `2.X`，但低于 `3`。"

#. type: delimited block = 5
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:140
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In here, the `a`, `b`, and `p` are used as if meaning \"alpha\", \"beta\" or "
"\"pre-release\" and \"patch level\", but they are only letters and are "
"sorted alphabetically, so any letter can be used, and they will be sorted "
"appropriately."
msgstr "这里的 `a`、`b` 和 `p` 分别被用作“alpha”、“beta”或“预发布版”以及“补丁级别”的含义，但它们实际上只是字母，并按字母顺序排序。因此可以使用任何字母，排序也会相应进行。"

