#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:164
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using `DISTVERSION`"
msgstr "使用 `DISTVERSION`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:168
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When the version only contains numbers separated by dots, dashes or "
"underscores, use `DISTVERSION`."
msgstr "如果版本仅包含由点、连字符或下划线分隔的数字，请使用 `DISTVERSION`。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:173
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=   nekoto\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t1.2-4\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=   nekoto\nDISTVERSION=\t1.2-4\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:176
#, fuzzy
msgid "It will generate a `PORTVERSION` of `1.2.4`."
msgstr "它会生成 `PORTVERSION` `1.2.4`。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:179
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using `DISTVERSION` When the Version Starts with a Letter or a Prefix"
msgstr "版本以字母或前缀开头时使用 `DISTVERSION`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:183
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When the version starts or ends with a letter, or a prefix or a suffix that "
"is not part of the version, use `DISTVERSIONPREFIX`, `DISTVERSION`, and "
"`DISTVERSIONSUFFIX`."
msgstr "如果版本以字母开头或结尾，或者带有不属于版本本身的前缀或后缀，请使用 `DISTVERSIONPREFIX`、`DISTVERSION` 和 `DISTVERSIONSUFFIX`。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:185
#, fuzzy
msgid "If the version is `v1.2-4`:"
msgstr "如果版本是 `v1.2-4`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:191
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=   nekoto\n"
"DISTVERSIONPREFIX=  v\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t1_2_4\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=   nekoto\nDISTVERSIONPREFIX=  v\nDISTVERSION=\t1_2_4\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:195
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some of the time, projects using GitHub will use their name in their "
"versions.  For example, the version could be `nekoto-1.2-4`:"
msgstr "有时，使用 GitHub 的项目会在版本中包含项目名称。例如，版本可能是 `nekoto-1.2-4`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:201
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=   nekoto\n"
"DISTVERSIONPREFIX=  nekoto-\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t1.2_4\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=   nekoto\nDISTVERSIONPREFIX=  nekoto-\nDISTVERSION=\t1.2_4\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:204
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Those projects also sometimes use some string at the end of the version, for "
"example, `1.2-4_RELEASE`:"
msgstr "这些项目有时也会在版本末尾使用字符串，例如 `1.2-4_RELEASE`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:210
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=   nekoto\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t1.2-4\n"
"DISTVERSIONSUFFIX=  _RELEASE\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=   nekoto\nDISTVERSION=\t1.2-4\nDISTVERSIONSUFFIX=  _RELEASE\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:213
#, fuzzy
msgid "Or they do both, for example, `nekoto-1.2-4_RELEASE`:"
msgstr "也可能同时使用两者，例如 `nekoto-1.2-4_RELEASE`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:220
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=   nekoto\n"
"DISTVERSIONPREFIX=  nekoto-\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t1.2-4\n"
"DISTVERSIONSUFFIX=  _RELEASE\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=   nekoto\nDISTVERSIONPREFIX=  nekoto-\nDISTVERSION=\t1.2-4\nDISTVERSIONSUFFIX=  _RELEASE\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:223
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`DISTVERSIONPREFIX` and `DISTVERSIONSUFFIX` will not be used while "
"constructing `PORTVERSION`, but only used in `DISTNAME`."
msgstr "构建 `PORTVERSION` 时不会使用 `DISTVERSIONPREFIX` 和 `DISTVERSIONSUFFIX`，它们只用于构建 `DISTNAME`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:225
#, fuzzy
msgid "All will generate a `PORTVERSION` of `1.2.4`."
msgstr "这些设置都会生成 `PORTVERSION` `1.2.4`。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:228
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using `DISTVERSION` When the Version Contains Letters Meaning \"alpha\", \"beta\", or \"pre-release\""
msgstr "版本中包含表示“alpha”、“beta”或“预发布版”的字母时使用 `DISTVERSION`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:232
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When the version contains numbers separated by dots, dashes or underscores, "
"and letters are used to mean \"alpha\", \"beta\" or \"pre-release\", which "
"is, before the version without the letters, use `DISTVERSION`."
msgstr "如果版本包含由点、连字符或下划线分隔的数字，并且用字母表示“alpha”、“beta”或“预发布版”（也就是早于不带这些字母的版本），请使用 `DISTVERSION`。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:237
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=   nekoto\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t1.2-pre4\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=   nekoto\nDISTVERSION=\t1.2-pre4\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:243
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=   nekoto\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t1.2p4\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=   nekoto\nDISTVERSION=\t1.2p4\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:246
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Both will generate a `PORTVERSION` of `1.2.p4` which is before than 1.2. man:"
"pkg-version[8] can be used to check that fact:"
msgstr "这两种设置都会生成 `PORTVERSION` `1.2.p4`，该版本早于 `1.2`。可以使用 man:pkg-version[8] 验证这一点："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:251
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% pkg version -t 1.2.p4 1.2\n"
"<\n"
msgstr "% pkg version -t 1.2.p4 1.2\n<\n"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:256
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Not Using `DISTVERSION` When the Version Contains Letters Meaning \"Patch Level\""
msgstr "版本中包含表示“补丁级别”的字母时不要使用 `DISTVERSION`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:260
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When the version contains letters that are not meant as \"alpha\", \"beta\", "
"or \"pre\", but more in a \"patch level\", and meaning after the version "
"without the letters, use `PORTVERSION`."
msgstr "如果版本中包含的字母并非表示“alpha”、“beta”或“预发布版”，而是表示“补丁级别”，且该版本应晚于不带这些字母的版本，请使用 `PORTVERSION`。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:265
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=   nekoto\n"
"PORTVERSION=\t1.2p4\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=   nekoto\nPORTVERSION=\t1.2p4\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:269
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In this case, using `DISTVERSION` is not possible because it would generate "
"a version of `1.2.p4` which would be before `1.2` and not after.  man:pkg-"
"version[8] will verify this:"
msgstr "在这种情况下，不能使用 `DISTVERSION`，因为它会生成版本 `1.2.p4`，该版本会早于 `1.2`，而不是晚于它。man:pkg-version[8] 可以验证这一点："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:276
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% pkg version -t 1.2 1.2.p4\n"
"> <.>\n"
"% pkg version -t 1.2 1.2p4\n"
"< <.>\n"
msgstr "% pkg version -t 1.2 1.2.p4\n> <.>\n% pkg version -t 1.2 1.2p4\n< <.>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:279
#, fuzzy
msgid "`1.2` is after `1.2.p4`, which is _wrong_ in this case."
