#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1511
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Simple Use of `USE_GITHUB`"
msgstr "`USE_GITHUB` 的简单用法"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1516
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"While trying to make a port for version `1.2.7` of pkg from the FreeBSD user "
"on github, at https://github.com/freebsd/pkg/[], The [.filename]#Makefile# "
"would end up looking like this (slightly stripped for the example):"
msgstr "尝试为 GitHub 上 FreeBSD 用户的 pkg 1.2.7 版本制作 Port，该用户的项目地址为 link:https://github.com/freebsd/pkg/[]，最终的 [.filename]#Makefile# 如下所示（为便于说明，略作删减）："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1521
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=\tpkg\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t1.2.7\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=\tpkg\nDISTVERSION=\t1.2.7\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1524
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USE_GITHUB=\tyes\n"
"GH_ACCOUNT=\tfreebsd\n"
msgstr "USE_GITHUB=\tyes\nGH_ACCOUNT=\tfreebsd\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1527
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It will automatically have `MASTER_SITES` set to `GH` and `WRKSRC` to `"
"${WRKDIR}/pkg-1.2.7`."
msgstr "它会自动将 `MASTER_SITES` 设置为 `GH`，并将 `WRKSRC` 设置为 `${WRKDIR}/pkg-1.2.7`。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1530
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "More Complete Use of `USE_GITHUB`"
msgstr "`USE_GITHUB` 的更完整用法"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1534
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"While trying to make a port for the bleeding edge version of pkg from the "
"FreeBSD user on github, at https://github.com/freebsd/pkg/[], the [."
"filename]#Makefile# ends up looking like this (slightly stripped for the "
"example):"
msgstr "尝试为 GitHub 上 FreeBSD 用户的 pkg 最新开发版本制作 Port，该用户的项目地址为 link:https://github.com/freebsd/pkg/[]，最终的 [.filename]#Makefile# 如下所示（为便于说明，略作删减）："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1539
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=\tpkg-devel\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t2.7.4.20260626\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=\tpkg-devel\nDISTVERSION=\t2.7.4.20260626\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1544
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USE_GITHUB=\tyes\n"
"GH_ACCOUNT=\tfreebsd\n"
"GH_PROJECT=\tpkg\n"
"GH_TAGNAME=\t2678d2b6a8ca3cf80cb4dbc8da557a2998e1b5c0\n"
msgstr "USE_GITHUB=\tyes\nGH_ACCOUNT=\tfreebsd\nGH_PROJECT=\tpkg\nGH_TAGNAME=\t2678d2b6a8ca3cf80cb4dbc8da557a2998e1b5c0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1547
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It will automatically have `MASTER_SITES` set to `GH` and `WRKSRC` to `"
"${WRKDIR}/pkg-6dbb17b`."
msgstr "它会自动将 `MASTER_SITES` 设置为 `GH`，并将 `WRKSRC` 设置为 `${WRKDIR}/pkg-6dbb17b`。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1551
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`20260626` is the date of the commit referenced in `GH_TAGNAME`, not the "
"date the [.filename]#Makefile# is edited, or the date the commit is made."
msgstr "`20260626` 是 `GH_TAGNAME` 所引用提交的日期，而不是编辑 [.filename]#Makefile# 的日期，也不是创建该提交的日期。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1556
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Use of `USE_GITHUB` with `DISTVERSIONPREFIX`"
msgstr "将 `USE_GITHUB` 与 `DISTVERSIONPREFIX` 配合使用"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1562
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"From time to time, `GH_TAGNAME` is a slight variation from `DISTVERSION`.  "
"For example, if the version is `1.0.2`, the tag is `v1.0.2`.  In those "
"cases, it is possible to use `DISTVERSIONPREFIX` or `DISTVERSIONSUFFIX`:"
msgstr "有时，`GH_TAGNAME` 与 `DISTVERSION` 略有不同。例如，版本号为 `1.0.2`，标签却是 `v1.0.2`。这种情况下，可以使用 `DISTVERSIONPREFIX` 或 `DISTVERSIONSUFFIX`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1568
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=\tfoo\n"
"DISTVERSIONPREFIX=\tv\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t1.0.2\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=\tfoo\nDISTVERSIONPREFIX=\tv\nDISTVERSION=\t1.0.2\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1570
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1634
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "USE_GITHUB=\tyes\n"
msgstr "USE_GITHUB=\tyes\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1573
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It will automatically set `GH_TAGNAME` to `v1.0.2`, while `WRKSRC` will be "
"kept to `${WRKDIR}/foo-1.0.2`."
msgstr "它会自动将 `GH_TAGNAME` 设置为 `v1.0.2`，而 `WRKSRC` 仍为 `${WRKDIR}/foo-1.0.2`。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1576
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using `USE_GITHUB` When Upstream Does Not Use Versions"
msgstr "上游没有版本号时使用 `USE_GITHUB`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1581
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If there never was a version upstream, do not invent one like `0.1` or "
"`1.0`.  Create the port with a `DISTVERSION` of `g__YYYYMMDD__`, where `g` "
"is for Git, and `_YYYYMMDD_` represents the date the commit referenced in "
"`GH_TAGNAME`."
msgstr "如果上游从未发布过版本，不要臆造 `0.1` 或 `1.0` 这样的版本号。创建 Port 时，将 `DISTVERSION` 设为 `g__YYYYMMDD__`，其中 `g` 表示 Git，__YYYYMMDD__ 表示 `GH_TAGNAME` 所引用提交的日期。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1586
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=\tbar\n"
"DISTVERSION=\tg20260626\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=\tbar\nDISTVERSION=\tg20260626\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1589
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USE_GITHUB=\tyes\n"
"GH_TAGNAME=\tc472d66b70dd603bf9e67607f0869639276796ce\n"
msgstr "USE_GITHUB=\tyes\nGH_TAGNAME=\tc472d66b70dd603bf9e67607f0869639276796ce\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1593
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This creates a versioning scheme that increases over time, and that is still "
"before version `0`.  See crossref:makefiles[makefile-versions-ex-pkg-"
"version, this section on how to compare versions] using man:pkg-version[8]:"
msgstr "这样便形成一种随时间递增、且仍小于版本 `0` 的版本方案。有关如何使用 man:pkg-version[8] 比较版本，请参见 crossref:makefiles[makefile-versions-ex-pkg-version,本节]："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1598
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% pkg version -t g20260626 0\n"
"<\n"
msgstr "% pkg version -t g20260626 0\n<\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1601
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Which means using `PORTEPOCH` will not be needed in case upstream decides to "
"cut versions in the future."
msgstr "这意味着，如果上游将来决定发布正式版本，就不需要使用 `PORTEPOCH`。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1604
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using `USE_GITHUB` to Access a Commit Between Two Versions"
msgstr "使用 `USE_GITHUB` 获取两个版本之间的提交"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1608
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the current version of the software uses a Git tag, and the port needs to "
"be updated to a newer, intermediate version, without a tag, use man:git-"
"describe[1] to find out the version to use:"
msgstr "如果当前软件版本使用 Git 标签，而 Port 需要更新到一个较新的中间版本（该版本没有标签），请使用 man:git-describe[1] 查找要使用的版本："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1613
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% git describe --tags f0038b1\n"
"v0.7.3-14-gf0038b1\n"
msgstr "% git describe --tags f0038b1\nv0.7.3-14-gf0038b1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1616
#, fuzzy
msgid "`v0.7.3-14-gf0038b1` can be split into three parts:"
msgstr "`v0.7.3-14-gf0038b1` 可分为三部分："

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1617
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`v0.7.3`"
msgstr "`v0.7.3`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1619
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is the last Git tag that appears in the commit history before the "
"requested commit."
msgstr "这是所请求提交之前、出现在提交历史中的最后一个 Git 标签。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1620
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`-14`"
msgstr "`-14`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1622
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This means that the requested commit, `f0038b1`, is the 14th commit after "
"the `v0.7.3` tag."
msgstr "这表示所请求的提交 `f0038b1` 位于 `v0.7.3` 标签之后的第 14 个提交。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1623
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`-gf0038b1`"
msgstr "`-gf0038b1`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1625
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `-g` means \"Git\", and the `f0038b1` is the commit hash that this "
"reference points to."
msgstr "`-g` 表示“Git”，而 `f0038b1` 是此引用指向的提交哈希值。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1632
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=\tbar\n"
"DISTVERSIONPREFIX=  v\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t0.7.3-14\n"
"DISTVERSIONSUFFIX=  -gf0038b1\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=\tbar\nDISTVERSIONPREFIX=  v\nDISTVERSION=\t0.7.3-14\nDISTVERSIONSUFFIX=  -gf0038b1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1638
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This creates a versioning scheme that increases over time (well, over "
"commits), and does not conflict with the creation of a `0.7.4` version.  See "
"crossref:makefiles[makefile-versions-ex-pkg-version, this section for how to "
"compare versions] using man:pkg-version[8]:"
msgstr "这样便形成一种随时间（更准确地说，随提交）递增的版本方案，并且不会与 `0.7.4` 版本冲突。有关如何使用 man:pkg-version[8] 比较版本，请参见 crossref:makefiles[makefile-versions-ex-pkg-version,本节]："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1645
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% pkg version -t 0.7.3 0.7.3.14\n"
"<\n"
"% pkg version -t 0.7.3.14 0.7.4\n"
"<\n"
msgstr "% pkg version -t 0.7.3 0.7.3.14\n<\n% pkg version -t 0.7.3.14 0.7.4\n<\n"

#. type: delimited block = 5
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1651
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the requested commit is the same as a tag, a shorter description is shown "
"by default.  The longer version is equivalent:"
msgstr "如果所请求的提交与某个标签相同，默认会显示较短的描述。较长的版本与之等效："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1656
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% git describe --tags c66c71d\n"
"v0.7.3\n"
msgstr "% git describe --tags c66c71d\nv0.7.3\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1659
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% git describe --tags --long c66c71d\n"
"v0.7.3-0-gc66c71d\n"
msgstr "% git describe --tags --long c66c71d\nv0.7.3-0-gc66c71d\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1666
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Fetching Multiple Files from GitHub"
msgstr "从 GitHub 获取多个文件"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1670
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `USE_GITHUB` framework also supports fetching multiple distribution "
"files from different places in GitHub.  It works in a way very similar to "
"crossref:makefiles[porting-master-sites-n, Multiple Distribution or Patches "
"Files from Multiple Locations]."
msgstr "`USE_GITHUB` 框架还支持从 GitHub 的不同位置获取多个发行文件。其工作方式与 crossref:makefiles[porting-master-sites-n,从多个位置获取多个发行文件或补丁文件]非常相似。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1676
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Multiple values are added to `GH_ACCOUNT`, `GH_PROJECT`, and `GH_TAGNAME`.  "
"Each different value is assigned a group.  The main value can either have no "
"group, or the `:DEFAULT` group.  A value can be omitted if it is the same as "
"the default as listed in crossref:makefiles[makefile-master_sites-github-"
"description,`USE_GITHUB` Description]."
msgstr "可以为 `GH_ACCOUNT`、`GH_PROJECT` 和 `GH_TAGNAME` 添加多个值。每个不同的值都分配一个组。主要值可以不指定组，也可以指定为 `:DEFAULT` 组。如果某个值与 crossref:makefiles[makefile-master_sites-github-description,`USE_GITHUB` 说明]中列出的默认值相同，则可以省略。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1679
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`GH_TUPLE` can also be used when there are a lot of distribution files.  It "
"helps keep the account, project, tagname, and group information at the same "
"place."
msgstr "发行文件较多时，也可以使用 `GH_TUPLE`。这样可以将账户、项目、标签名和组的信息集中在一处。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1682
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1986
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For each group, a `${WRKSRC_group}` helper variable is created, containing "
"the directory into which the file has been extracted.  The `${WRKSRC_group}` "
"variables can be used to move directories around during `post-extract`, or "
"add to `CONFIGURE_ARGS`, or whatever is needed so that the software builds "
"correctly."
msgstr "每个组都会创建一个 `${WRKSRC_group}` 辅助变量，其中包含文件解压到的目录。可以在 `post-extract` 期间使用 `${WRKSRC_group}` 变量移动目录，也可以将其添加到 `CONFIGURE_ARGS`，或按需进行其他操作，以确保软件能够正确构建。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1687
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1991
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `:__group__` part _must_ be used for _only one_ distribution file.  It "
"is used as a unique key and using it more than once will overwrite the "
"previous values."
msgstr "`:__group__` 部分__必须__仅用于一个发行文件。它用作唯一键；重复使用会覆盖先前的值。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1694
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1998
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As this is only syntactic sugar above `DISTFILES` and `MASTER_SITES`, the "
"group names must adhere to the restrictions on group names outlined in "
"crossref:makefiles[porting-master-sites-n, Multiple Distribution or Patches "
"Files from Multiple Locations]"
msgstr "由于这只是 `DISTFILES` 和 `MASTER_SITES` 的语法糖，组名必须遵守 crossref:makefiles[porting-master-sites-n,从多个位置获取多个发行文件或补丁文件]中所述的组名限制。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1698
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When fetching multiple files from GitHub, sometimes the default distribution "
"file is not fetched from GitHub.  To disable fetching the default "
"distribution, set:"
msgstr "从 GitHub 获取多个文件时，有时默认发行文件并非从 GitHub 获取。要禁用默认发行文件的获取，请设置："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1702
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "USE_GITHUB=\tnodefault\n"
msgstr "USE_GITHUB=\tnodefault\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1707
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When using `USE_GITHUB=nodefault`, the [.filename]#Makefile# must set "
"`DISTFILES` in its crossref:porting-order[porting-order-portname,top block]. "
"The definition should be:"
msgstr "使用 `USE_GITHUB=nodefault` 时，[.filename]#Makefile# 必须在其 crossref:porting-order[porting-order-portname,顶部区块]中设置 `DISTFILES`。其定义应为："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1711
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2017
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "DISTFILES=    ${DISTNAME}${EXTRACT_SUFX}\n"
msgstr "DISTFILES=    ${DISTNAME}${EXTRACT_SUFX}\n"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1716
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Use of `USE_GITHUB` with Multiple Distribution Files"
msgstr "`USE_GITHUB` 与多个发行文件配合使用"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1722
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"From time to time, there is a need to fetch more than one distribution "
"file.  For example, when the upstream git repository uses submodules.  This "
"can be done easily using groups in the `GH_*` variables:"
msgstr "有时需要获取多个发行文件。例如，上游 Git 仓库使用了子模块。可以轻松地通过 `GH_*` 变量中的组来实现："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1727
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1773
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2033
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2079
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=\tfoo\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t1.0.2\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=\tfoo\nDISTVERSION=\t1.0.2\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1733
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USE_GITHUB=\tyes\n"
"GH_ACCOUNT=\tbar:icons,contrib\n"
"GH_PROJECT=\tfoo-icons:icons foo-contrib:contrib\n"
"GH_TAGNAME=\t1.0:icons fa579bc:contrib\n"
"GH_SUBDIR=\text/icons:icons\n"
msgstr "USE_GITHUB=\tyes\nGH_ACCOUNT=\tbar:icons,contrib\nGH_PROJECT=\tfoo-icons:icons foo-contrib:contrib\nGH_TAGNAME=\t1.0:icons fa579bc:contrib\nGH_SUBDIR=\text/icons:icons\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1735
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1779
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "CONFIGURE_ARGS=\t--with-contrib=${WRKSRC_contrib}\n"
msgstr "CONFIGURE_ARGS=\t--with-contrib=${WRKSRC_contrib}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1742
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This will fetch three distribution files from github.  The default one comes "
"from [.filename]#foo/foo# and is version `1.0.2`.  The second one, with the "
"`icons` group, comes from [.filename]#bar/foo-icons# and is in version "
"`1.0`.  The third one comes from [.filename]#bar/foo-contrib# and uses the "
"Git commit `fa579bc`.  The distribution files are named [.filename]#foo-"
"foo-1.0.2_GH0.tar.gz#, [.filename]#bar-foo-icons-1.0_GH0.tar.gz#, and [."
"filename]#bar-foo-contrib-fa579bc_GH0.tar.gz#."
msgstr "这会从 GitHub 获取三个发行文件。默认文件来自 [.filename]#foo/foo#，版本为 `1.0.2`。第二个文件属于 `icons` 组，来自 [.filename]#bar/foo-icons#，版本为 `1.0`。第三个文件来自 [.filename]#bar/foo-contrib#，使用 Git 提交 `fa579bc`。这些发行文件的名称分别为 [.filename]#foo-foo-1.0.2_GH0.tar.gz#、[.filename]#bar-foo-icons-1.0_GH0.tar.gz# 和 [.filename]#bar-foo-contrib-fa579bc_GH0.tar.gz#。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1748
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All the distribution files are extracted in `${WRKDIR}` in their respective "
"subdirectories.  The default file is still extracted in `${WRKSRC}`, in this "
"case, [.filename]#${WRKDIR}/foo-1.0.2#.  Each additional distribution file "
"is extracted in `${WRKSRC_group}`.  Here, for the `icons` group, it is "
"called `${WRKSRC_icons}` and it contains [.filename]#${WRKDIR}/foo-"
"icons-1.0#.  The file with the `contrib` group is called `${WRKSRC_contrib}` "
"and contains `${WRKDIR}/foo-contrib-fa579bc`."
msgstr "所有发行文件都会解压到 `${WRKDIR}` 下各自的子目录中。默认文件仍会解压到 `${WRKSRC}`，在此例中即 [.filename]#${WRKDIR}/foo-1.0.2#。每个额外的发行文件都会解压到 `${WRKSRC_group}` 中。这里，`icons` 组对应 `${WRKSRC_icons}`，其中包含 [.filename]#${WRKDIR}/foo-icons-1.0#。`contrib` 组对应 `${WRKSRC_contrib}`，其中包含 `${WRKDIR}/foo-contrib-fa579bc`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1752
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The software's build system expects to find the icons in a [.filename]#ext/"
"icons# subdirectory in its sources, so `GH_SUBDIR` is used.  `GH_SUBDIR` "
"makes sure that [.filename]#ext# exists, but that [.filename]#ext/icons# "
"does not already exist.  Then it does this:"
msgstr "软件的构建系统预期在源代码的 [.filename]#ext/icons# 子目录中找到图标，因此要使用 `GH_SUBDIR`。`GH_SUBDIR` 会确保 [.filename]#ext# 目录存在，同时确保 [.filename]#ext/icons# 目录尚不存在。然后执行以下操作："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1757
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"post-extract:\n"
"      @${MV} ${WRKSRC_icons} ${WRKSRC}/ext/icons\n"
msgstr "post-extract:\n      @${MV} ${WRKSRC_icons} ${WRKSRC}/ext/icons\n"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1762
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Use of `USE_GITHUB` with Multiple Distribution Files Using `GH_TUPLE`"
msgstr "使用 `GH_TUPLE` 将 `USE_GITHUB` 与多个发行文件配合使用"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1768
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is functionally equivalent to crossref:makefiles[makefile-master_sites-"
"github-multi,Use of `USE_GITHUB` with Multiple Distribution Files], but "
"using `GH_TUPLE`:"
msgstr "这在功能上等同于 crossref:makefiles[makefile-master_sites-github-multi,将 `USE_GITHUB` 与多个发行文件配合使用]，但这里使用的是 `GH_TUPLE`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1777
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USE_GITHUB=\tyes\n"
"GH_TUPLE=\tbar:foo-icons:1.0:icons/ext/icons \\\n"
"\t\tbar:foo-contrib:fa579bc:contrib\n"
msgstr "USE_GITHUB=\tyes\nGH_TUPLE=\tbar:foo-icons:1.0:icons/ext/icons \\\n\t\tbar:foo-contrib:fa579bc:contrib\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1783
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Grouping was used in the previous example with `bar:icons,contrib`.  Some "
"redundant information is present with `GH_TUPLE` because grouping is not "
"possible."
msgstr "前面的示例使用了 `bar:icons,contrib` 分组。由于 `GH_TUPLE` 不支持分组，因此其中包含一些冗余信息。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1786
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "How to Use `USE_GITHUB` with Git Submodules?"
msgstr "如何将 `USE_GITHUB` 与 Git 子模块配合使用？"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1791
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Ports with GitHub as an upstream repository sometimes use submodules.  See "
"man:git-submodule[1] for more information."
msgstr "以上游仓库托管在 GitHub 上的 Port 有时会使用子模块。有关详细信息，请参阅 man:git-submodule[1]。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1794
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The problem with submodules is that each is a separate repository.  As such, "
"they each must be fetched separately."
msgstr "子模块的问题在于，每个子模块都是一个独立的仓库。因此，必须分别获取每个子模块。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1799
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Using package:finance/moneymanagerex[] as an example, its GitHub repository "
"is https://github.com/moneymanagerex/moneymanagerex/[].  It has a https://"
"github.com/moneymanagerex/moneymanagerex/blob/master/.gitmodules[."
"gitmodules] file at the root.  This file describes all the submodules used "
"in this repository, and lists additional repositories needed.  This file "
"will tell what additional repositories are needed:"
msgstr "以 package:finance/moneymanagerex[] 为例，其 GitHub 仓库位于 link:https://github.com/moneymanagerex/moneymanagerex/[]。仓库根目录下有一个 link:https://github.com/moneymanagerex/moneymanagerex/blob/master/.gitmodules[.gitmodules] 文件。此文件描述了该仓库中使用的所有子模块，并列出了所需的其他仓库。此文件会告知还需要哪些仓库："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1815
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[submodule \"lib/wxsqlite3\"]\n"
"\tpath = lib/wxsqlite3\n"
"\turl = https://github.com/utelle/wxsqlite3.git\n"
"[submodule \"3rd/mongoose\"]\n"
"\tpath = 3rd/mongoose\n"
"\turl = https://github.com/cesanta/mongoose.git\n"
"[submodule \"3rd/LuaGlue\"]\n"
"\tpath = 3rd/LuaGlue\n"
"\turl = https://github.com/moneymanagerex/LuaGlue.git\n"
"[submodule \"3rd/cgitemplate\"]\n"
"\tpath = 3rd/cgitemplate\n"
"\turl = https://github.com/moneymanagerex/html-template.git\n"
"[...]\n"
msgstr "[submodule \"lib/wxsqlite3\"]\n\tpath = lib/wxsqlite3\n\turl = https://github.com/utelle/wxsqlite3.git\n[submodule \"3rd/mongoose\"]\n\tpath = 3rd/mongoose\n\turl = https://github.com/cesanta/mongoose.git\n[submodule \"3rd/LuaGlue\"]\n\tpath = 3rd/LuaGlue\n\turl = https://github.com/moneymanagerex/LuaGlue.git\n[submodule \"3rd/cgitemplate\"]\n\tpath = 3rd/cgitemplate\n\turl = https://github.com/moneymanagerex/html-template.git\n[...]\n"

