msgstr "更完整的用法示例如下：假设 Port 没有版本信息，且要获取 foo 用户在自托管 GitLab 站点 `https://gitlab.example.com/` 上 bar 项目的 foobar，那么用于获取发行文件的 [.filename]#Makefile# 如下所示："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1948
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=\tfoobar\n"
"DISTVERSION=\tg20170906\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=\tfoobar\nDISTVERSION=\tg20170906\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1954
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USE_GITLAB=\tyes\n"
"GL_SITE=\thttps://gitlab.example.com\n"
"GL_ACCOUNT=\tfoo\n"
"GL_PROJECT=\tbar\n"
"GL_COMMIT=\t9c1669ce60c3f4f5eb43df874d7314483fb3f8a6\n"
msgstr "USE_GITLAB=\tyes\nGL_SITE=\thttps://gitlab.example.com\nGL_ACCOUNT=\tfoo\nGL_PROJECT=\tbar\nGL_COMMIT=\t9c1669ce60c3f4f5eb43df874d7314483fb3f8a6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1957
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It will have `MASTER_SITES` set to `\"https://gitlab.example.com\"` and "
"`WRKSRC` to `${WRKDIR}/"
"bar-9c1669ce60c3f4f5eb43df874d7314483fb3f8a6-9c1669ce60c3f4f5eb43df874d7314483fb3f8a6`."
msgstr "它会将 `MASTER_SITES` 设置为 `\"https://gitlab.example.com\"`，并将 `WRKSRC` 设置为 `${WRKDIR}/bar-9c1669ce60c3f4f5eb43df874d7314483fb3f8a6-9c1669ce60c3f4f5eb43df874d7314483fb3f8a6`。"

#. type: delimited block = 6
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1961
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`20170906` is the date of the commit referenced in `GL_COMMIT`, not the date "
"the [.filename]#Makefile# is edited, or the date the commit to the FreeBSD "
"ports tree is made."
msgstr "`20170906` 是 `GL_COMMIT` 所引用提交的日期，不是编辑 [.filename]#Makefile# 的日期，也不是向 FreeBSD ports 树提交更改的日期。"

#. type: delimited block = 6
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1966
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``GL_SITE``'s protocol, port and webroot can all be modified in the same "
"variable."
msgstr "``GL_SITE`` 的协议、端口和 Web 根目录都可以在同一个变量中修改。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1971
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Fetching Multiple Files from GitLab"
msgstr "从 GitLab 获取多个文件"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1976
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `USE_GITLAB` framework also supports fetching multiple distribution "
"files from different places from GitLab and GitLab hosted sites.  It works "
"in a way very similar to crossref:makefiles[porting-master-sites-n, Multiple "
"Distribution or Patches Files from Multiple Locations] and crossref:"
"makefiles[makefile-master_sites-github-multiple, Fetching Multiple Files "
"from GitHub]."
msgstr "`USE_GITLAB` 框架还支持从不同的 GitLab 站点和 GitLab 托管站点获取多个发行文件。其工作方式与 crossref:makefiles[porting-master-sites-n,从多个位置获取多个发行文件或补丁文件] 和 crossref:makefiles[makefile-master_sites-github-multiple,从 GitHub 获取多个文件] 非常相似。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1980
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Multiple values are added to `GL_SITE`, `GL_ACCOUNT`, `GL_PROJECT` and "
"`GL_COMMIT`.  Each different value is assigned a group.  crossref:"
"makefiles[makefile-master_sites-gitlab-description,`USE_GITLAB` Description]."
msgstr "可以为 `GL_SITE`、`GL_ACCOUNT`、`GL_PROJECT` 和 `GL_COMMIT` 添加多个值。每个不同的值都分配给一个组。请参阅 crossref:makefiles[makefile-master_sites-gitlab-description,`USE_GITLAB` 说明]。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:1983
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`GL_TUPLE` can also be used when there are a lot of distribution files.  It "
"helps keep the site, account, project, commit, and group information at the "
"same place."
msgstr "发行文件较多时，也可以使用 `GL_TUPLE`。它有助于将站点、账户、项目、提交和组的信息放在一起。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2002
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When fetching multiple files using GitLab, sometimes the default "
"distribution file is not fetched from a GitLab site.  To disable fetching "
"the default distribution, set:"
msgstr "使用 GitLab 获取多个文件时，有时默认发行文件并非来自 GitLab 站点。要禁用默认发行文件的获取，请设置："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2006
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "USE_GITLAB=\tnodefault\n"
msgstr "USE_GITLAB=\tnodefault\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2013
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When using `USE_GITLAB=nodefault`, the [.filename]#Makefile# must set "
"`DISTFILES` in its crossref:makefiles[porting-order-portname,top block].  "
"The definition should be:"
msgstr "使用 `USE_GITLAB=nodefault` 时，必须在 [.filename]#Makefile# 的 crossref:makefiles[porting-order-portname,顶部区块] 中设置 `DISTFILES`。其定义应为："

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2022
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Use of `USE_GITLAB` with Multiple Distribution Files"
msgstr "将 `USE_GITLAB` 用于多个发行文件"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2028
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"From time to time, there is a need to fetch more than one distribution "
"file.  For example, when the upstream git repository uses submodules.  This "
"can be done easily using groups in the `GL_*` variables:"
msgstr "有时需要获取多个发行文件。例如，上游 Git 仓库使用子模块时。可以轻松地通过 `GL_*` 变量中的组来实现："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2040
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USE_GITLAB=\tyes\n"
"GL_SITE=\thttps://gitlab.example.com:9434/gitlab:icons\n"
"GL_ACCOUNT=\tbar:icons,contrib\n"
"GL_PROJECT=\tfoo-icons:icons foo-contrib:contrib\n"
"GL_COMMIT=\tc189207a55da45305c884fe2b50e086fcad4724b ae7368cab1ca7ca754b38d49da064df87968ffe4:icons 9e4dd76ad9b38f33fdb417a4c01935958d5acd2a:contrib\n"
"GL_SUBDIR=\text/icons:icons\n"
msgstr "USE_GITLAB=\tyes\nGL_SITE=\thttps://gitlab.example.com:9434/gitlab:icons\nGL_ACCOUNT=\tbar:icons,contrib\nGL_PROJECT=\tfoo-icons:icons foo-contrib:contrib\nGL_COMMIT=\tc189207a55da45305c884fe2b50e086fcad4724b ae7368cab1ca7ca754b38d49da064df87968ffe4:icons 9e4dd76ad9b38f33fdb417a4c01935958d5acd2a:contrib\nGL_SUBDIR=\text/icons:icons\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2042
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2086
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "CONFIGURE_ARGS= --with-contrib=${WRKSRC_contrib}\n"
msgstr "CONFIGURE_ARGS= --with-contrib=${WRKSRC_contrib}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2049
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This will fetch two distribution files from gitlab.com and one from `gitlab."
"example.com` hosting GitLab.  The default one comes from [.filename]#https://"
"gitlab.com/foo/foo# and commit is "
"`c189207a55da45305c884fe2b50e086fcad4724b`.  The second one, with the "
"`icons` group, comes from [.filename]#https://gitlab.example.com:9434/gitlab/"
"bar/foo-icons# and commit is `ae7368cab1ca7ca754b38d49da064df87968ffe4`.  "
"The third one comes from [.filename]#https://gitlab.com/bar/foo-contrib# and "
"is commit `9e4dd76ad9b38f33fdb417a4c01935958d5acd2a`.  The distribution "
"files are named [.filename]#foo-foo-"
"c189207a55da45305c884fe2b50e086fcad4724b_GL0.tar.gz#, [.filename]#bar-foo-"
"icons-ae7368cab1ca7ca754b38d49da064df87968ffe4_GL0.tar.gz#, and [."
"filename]#bar-foo-contrib-9e4dd76ad9b38f33fdb417a4c01935958d5acd2a_GL0.tar."
"gz#."
msgstr "这将从 gitlab.com 获取两个发行文件，并从托管 GitLab 的 `gitlab.example.com` 获取一个。默认文件来自 [.filename]# link:https://gitlab.com/foo/foo#，提交为[] `c189207a55da45305c884fe2b50e086fcad4724b`。第二个文件属于 `icons` 组，来自 [.filename]# link:https://gitlab.example.com:9434/gitlab/bar/foo-icons#，提交为[] `ae7368cab1ca7ca754b38d49da064df87968ffe4`。第三个文件来自 [.filename]# link:https://gitlab.com/bar/foo-contrib#，提交为[] `9e4dd76ad9b38f33fdb417a4c01935958d5acd2a`。这些发行文件的名称分别为 [.filename]#foo-foo-c189207a55da45305c884fe2b50e086fcad4724b_GL0.tar.gz#、[.filename]#bar-foo-icons-ae7368cab1ca7ca754b38d49da064df87968ffe4_GL0.tar.gz# 和 [.filename]#bar-foo-contrib-9e4dd76ad9b38f33fdb417a4c01935958d5acd2a_GL0.tar.gz#。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2055
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All the distribution files are extracted in `${WRKDIR}` in their respective "
"subdirectories.  The default file is still extracted in `${WRKSRC}`, in this "
"case, [.filename]#${WRKDIR}/foo-c189207a55da45305c884fe2b50e086fcad4724b-"
"c189207a55da45305c884fe2b50e086fcad4724b#.  Each additional distribution "
"file is extracted in `${WRKSRC_group}`.  Here, for the `icons` group, it is "
"called `${WRKSRC_icons}` and it contains [.filename]#${WRKDIR}/foo-icons-"
"ae7368cab1ca7ca754b38d49da064df87968ffe4-"
"ae7368cab1ca7ca754b38d49da064df87968ffe4#.  The file with the `contrib` "
"group is called `${WRKSRC_contrib}` and contains `${WRKDIR}/foo-"
"contrib-9e4dd76ad9b38f33fdb417a4c01935958d5acd2a-9e4dd76ad9b38f33fdb417a4c01935958d5acd2a`."
msgstr "所有发行文件都会解压到 `${WRKDIR}` 中各自的子目录。默认文件仍会解压到 `${WRKSRC}` 中；在此例中，该目录为 [.filename]#${WRKDIR}/foo-c189207a55da45305c884fe2b50e086fcad4724b-c189207a55da45305c884fe2b50e086fcad4724b#。每个额外的发行文件都会解压到 `${WRKSRC_group}` 中。此处，`icons` 组的目录名为 `${WRKSRC_icons}`，其中包含 [.filename]#${WRKDIR}/foo-icons-ae7368cab1ca7ca754b38d49da064df87968ffe4-ae7368cab1ca7ca754b38d49da064df87968ffe4#。`contrib` 组文件的目录名为 `${WRKSRC_contrib}`，其中包含 `${WRKDIR}/foo-contrib-9e4dd76ad9b38f33fdb417a4c01935958d5acd2a-9e4dd76ad9b38f33fdb417a4c01935958d5acd2a`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2059
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The software's build system expects to find the icons in a [.filename]#ext/"
"icons# subdirectory in its sources, so `GL_SUBDIR` is used.  `GL_SUBDIR` "
"makes sure that [.filename]#ext# exists, but that [.filename]#ext/icons# "
"does not already exist.  Then it does this:"
msgstr "该软件的构建系统预期在源代码中的 [.filename]#ext/icons# 子目录中找到图标，因此需要使用 `GL_SUBDIR`。`GL_SUBDIR` 会确保 [.filename]#ext# 存在，但 [.filename]#ext/icons# 尚不存在。然后执行以下操作："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2064
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"post-extract:\n"
"        @${MV} ${WRKSRC_icons} ${WRKSRC}/ext/icons\n"
msgstr "post-extract:\n        @${MV} ${WRKSRC_icons} ${WRKSRC}/ext/icons\n"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2069
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Use of `USE_GITLAB` with Multiple Distribution Files Using `GL_TUPLE`"
msgstr "使用 `GL_TUPLE` 将 `USE_GITLAB` 用于多个发行文件"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2074
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is functionally equivalent to crossref:makefiles[makefile-master_sites-"
"gitlab-multi,Use of `USE_GITLAB` with Multiple Distribution Files], but "
"using `GL_TUPLE`:"
msgstr "其功能等同于 crossref:makefiles[makefile-master_sites-gitlab-multi,将 `USE_GITLAB` 用于多个发行文件]，但使用了 `GL_TUPLE`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2084
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USE_GITLAB=\tyes\n"
"GL_COMMIT=\tc189207a55da45305c884fe2b50e086fcad4724b\n"
"GL_TUPLE=\thttps://gitlab.example.com:9434/gitlab:bar:foo-icons:ae7368cab1ca7ca754b38d49da064df87968ffe4:icons/ext/icons \\\n"
"\t\tbar:foo-contrib:9e4dd76ad9b38f33fdb417a4c01935958d5acd2a:contrib\n"
msgstr "USE_GITLAB=\tyes\nGL_COMMIT=\tc189207a55da45305c884fe2b50e086fcad4724b\nGL_TUPLE=\thttps://gitlab.example.com:9434/gitlab:bar:foo-icons:ae7368cab1ca7ca754b38d49da064df87968ffe4:icons/ext/icons \\\n\t\tbar:foo-contrib:9e4dd76ad9b38f33fdb417a4c01935958d5acd2a:contrib\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2090
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Grouping was used in the previous example with `bar:icons,contrib`.  Some "
"redundant information is present with `GL_TUPLE` because grouping is not "
"possible."
msgstr "前一个示例使用了分组 `bar:icons,contrib`。由于 `GL_TUPLE` 不支持分组，因此其中包含了一些冗余信息。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2093
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`EXTRACT_SUFX`"
msgstr "`EXTRACT_SUFX`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2096
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If there is one distribution file, and it uses an odd suffix to indicate the "
"compression mechanism, set `EXTRACT_SUFX`."
msgstr "如果只有一个发行文件，且它使用特殊后缀来表示压缩方式，请设置 `EXTRACT_SUFX`。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2098
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For example, if the distribution file was named [.filename]#foo.tar.gzip# "
"instead of the more normal [.filename]#foo.tar.gz#, write:"
msgstr "例如，如果发行文件名为 [.filename]#foo.tar.gzip#，而不是更常见的 [.filename]#foo.tar.gz#，则应写为："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2103
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"DISTNAME=\tfoo\n"
"EXTRACT_SUFX=\t.tar.gzip\n"
msgstr "DISTNAME=\tfoo\nEXTRACT_SUFX=\t.tar.gzip\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2107
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `USES=tar[:__xxx__]`, `USES=lha` or `USES=zip` automatically set "
"`EXTRACT_SUFX` to the most common archives extensions as necessary, see "
"crossref:uses[uses,Using `USES` Macros] for more details.  If neither of "
"these are set then `EXTRACT_SUFX` defaults to `.tar.gz`."
msgstr "`USES=tar[:__xxx__]`、`USES=lha` 或 `USES=zip` 会根据需要自动将 `EXTRACT_SUFX` 设置为最常见的归档扩展名。有关详细信息，请参阅 crossref:uses[uses,使用 `USES` 宏]。如果这些都未设置，则 `EXTRACT_SUFX` 默认为 `.tar.gz`。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2111
#, fuzzy
msgid "As `EXTRACT_SUFX` is only used in `DISTFILES`, only set one of them.."
msgstr "由于 `EXTRACT_SUFX` 仅用于 `DISTFILES`，因此只设置其中一个即可。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2114
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4878
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`DISTFILES`"
msgstr "`DISTFILES`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2119
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sometimes the names of the files to be downloaded have no resemblance to the "
"name of the port.  For example, it might be called [.filename]#source.tar."
"gz# or similar.  In other cases the application's source code might be in "
"several different archives, all of which must be downloaded."
msgstr "有时要下载的文件名与 Port 名称毫无关联。例如，文件可能名为 [.filename]#source.tar.gz# 或类似名称。在其他情况下，应用程序的源代码可能分散在多个不同的归档文件中，必须全部下载。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2121
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If this is the case, set `DISTFILES` to be a space separated list of all the "
"files that must be downloaded."
msgstr "如果是这种情况，请将 `DISTFILES` 设置为空格分隔的列表，其中包含必须下载的所有文件。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2125
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "DISTFILES=\tsource1.tar.gz source2.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "DISTFILES=\tsource1.tar.gz source2.tar.gz\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2128
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If not explicitly set, `DISTFILES` defaults to `${DISTNAME}${EXTRACT_SUFX}`."
msgstr "如果未显式设置，`DISTFILES` 默认为 `${DISTNAME}${EXTRACT_SUFX}`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2130
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4879
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`EXTRACT_ONLY`"
msgstr "`EXTRACT_ONLY`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2133
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If only some of the `DISTFILES` must be extracted-for example, one of them "
"is the source code, while another is an uncompressed document-list the "
"filenames that must be extracted in `EXTRACT_ONLY`."
msgstr "如果只需解压部分 `DISTFILES` 中的文件，例如，其中一个是源代码，而另一个是未压缩的文档，请在 `EXTRACT_ONLY` 中列出需要解压的文件名。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2138
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"DISTFILES=\tsource.tar.gz manual.html\n"
"EXTRACT_ONLY=\tsource.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "DISTFILES=\tsource.tar.gz manual.html\nEXTRACT_ONLY=\tsource.tar.gz\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2141
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When none of the `DISTFILES` need to be uncompressed, set `EXTRACT_ONLY` to "
"the empty string."
msgstr "如果 `DISTFILES` 中的文件都不需要解压，请将 `EXTRACT_ONLY` 设置为空字符串。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2145
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "EXTRACT_ONLY=\n"
msgstr "EXTRACT_ONLY=\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2148
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4900
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`PATCHFILES`"
msgstr "`PATCHFILES`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2151
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the port requires some additional patches that are available by FTP or "
"HTTP, set `PATCHFILES` to the names of the files and `PATCH_SITES` to the "
"URL of the directory that contains them (the format is the same as "
"`MASTER_SITES`)."
msgstr "如果 Port 需要通过 FTP 或 HTTP 获取额外补丁，请将文件名设置到 `PATCHFILES`，并将包含这些文件的目录 URL 设置到 `PATCH_SITES`（格式与 `MASTER_SITES` 相同）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2154
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the patch is not relative to the top of the source tree (that is, "
"`WRKSRC`) because it contains some extra pathnames, set `PATCH_DIST_STRIP` "
"accordingly.  For instance, if all the pathnames in the patch have an extra "
"`foozolix-1.0/` in front of the filenames, then set `PATCH_DIST_STRIP=-p1`."
msgstr "如果补丁不是相对于源代码树顶层（即 `WRKSRC`）的，因为其中包含额外的路径名，请相应设置 `PATCH_DIST_STRIP`。例如，如果补丁中的所有路径名前面都多了 `foozolix-1.0/`，则设置 `PATCH_DIST_STRIP=-p1`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2156
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Do not worry if the patches are compressed; they will be decompressed "
"automatically if the filenames end with [.filename]#.Z#, [.filename]#.gz#, [."
"filename]#.bz2# or [.filename]#.xz#."
msgstr "如果补丁文件名以 [.filename]#.Z#、[.filename]#.gz#、[.filename]#.bz2# 或 [.filename]#.xz# 结尾，即使补丁经过压缩也无需担心；系统会自动解压。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2162
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the patch is distributed with some other files, such as documentation, in "
"a compressed tarball, using `PATCHFILES` is not possible.  If that is the "
"case, add the name and the location of the patch tarball to `DISTFILES` and "
"`MASTER_SITES`.  Then, use `EXTRA_PATCHES` to point to those files and [."
"filename]#bsd.port.mk# will automatically apply them.  In particular, do "
"_not_ copy patch files into [.filename]#${PATCHDIR}#.  That directory may "
"not be writable."
msgstr "如果补丁与文档等其他文件一起打包在压缩 tarball 中，就不能使用 `PATCHFILES`。在这种情况下，请将补丁 tarball 的名称和位置添加到 `DISTFILES` 和 `MASTER_SITES`。然后，使用 `EXTRA_PATCHES` 指定这些文件， [.filename]#bsd.port.mk# 会自动应用它们。特别是，不要将补丁文件复制到 [.filename]#${PATCHDIR}# 中。该目录可能不可写。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2166
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If there are multiple patches and they need mixed values for the strip "
"parameter, it can be added alongside the patch name in `PATCHFILES`, e.g:"
msgstr "如果有多个补丁，且需要使用不同的 strip 参数值，可以将参数与补丁名称一起添加到 `PATCHFILES` 中，例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2170
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "PATCHFILES=\tpatch1 patch2:-p1\n"
msgstr "PATCHFILES=\tpatch1 patch2:-p1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2173
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This does not conflict with crossref:makefiles[porting-master-sites-n,the "
"master site grouping feature], adding a group also works:"
msgstr "这与 crossref:makefiles[porting-master-sites-n,主站点分组功能]并不冲突，添加分组同样可行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2177
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "PATCHFILES=\tpatch2:-p1:source2\n"
msgstr "PATCHFILES=\tpatch2:-p1:source2\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2185
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The tarball will have been extracted alongside the regular source by then, "
"so there is no need to explicitly extract it if it is a regular compressed "
"tarball. Take extra care not to overwrite something that already exists in "
"that directory if extracting it manually.  Also, do not forget to add a "
"command to remove the copied patch in the `pre-clean` target."
msgstr "到这时，tarball 已经与常规源代码一起解压，因此如果它是常规的压缩 tarball，就无需显式解压。手动解压时要格外小心，不要覆盖该目录中已有的内容。另外，别忘了在 `pre-clean` 目标中添加命令，以删除复制的补丁。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2188
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Multiple Distribution or Patches Files from Multiple Locations"
msgstr "来自多个位置的多个发行文件或补丁文件"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2191
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"(Consider this to be a somewhat \"advanced topic\"; those new to this "
"document may wish to skip this section at first)."
msgstr "（请将此内容视为一个有些“高级”的主题；初次阅读本文档的读者可以先跳过本节。）"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2194
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This section has information on the fetching mechanism known as both "
"`MASTER_SITES:n` and `MASTER_SITES_NN`.  We will refer to this mechanism as "
"`MASTER_SITES:n`."
msgstr "本节介绍一种称为 `MASTER_SITES:n` 和 `MASTER_SITES_NN` 的获取机制。我们将这种机制称为 `MASTER_SITES:n`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2199
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A little background first.  OpenBSD has a neat feature inside `DISTFILES` "
"and `PATCHFILES` which allows files and patches to be postfixed with `:n` "
"identifiers.  Here, `n` can be any word containing `[0-9a-zA-Z_]` and denote "
"a group designation.  For example:"
msgstr "先介绍一些背景知识。OpenBSD 的 `DISTFILES` 和 `PATCHFILES` 有一项实用功能，允许在文件和补丁后附加 `:n` 标识符。这里的 `n` 可以是包含 `[0-9a-zA-Z_]` 中任意字符的单词，并表示一个分组。例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2203
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "DISTFILES=\talpha:0 beta:1\n"
msgstr "DISTFILES=\talpha:0 beta:1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2206
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In OpenBSD, distribution file [.filename]#alpha# will be associated with "
"variable `MASTER_SITES0` instead of our common `MASTER_SITES` and [."
"filename]#beta# with `MASTER_SITES1`."
msgstr "在 OpenBSD 中，发行文件 [.filename]#alpha# 会与变量 `MASTER_SITES0` 关联，而不是与常用的 `MASTER_SITES` 关联；[.filename]#beta# 则与 `MASTER_SITES1` 关联。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2208
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is a very interesting feature which can decrease that endless search "
"for the correct download site."
msgstr "这是一项非常实用的功能，可以减少为寻找正确下载站点而进行的无休止搜索。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2211
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Just picture 2 files in `DISTFILES` and 20 sites in `MASTER_SITES`, the "
"sites slow as hell where [.filename]#beta# is carried by all sites in "
"`MASTER_SITES`, and [.filename]#alpha# can only be found in the 20th site.  "
"It would be such a waste to check all of them if the maintainer knew this "
"beforehand, would it not? Not a good start for that lovely weekend!"
msgstr "想象一下，`DISTFILES` 中有 2 个文件，`MASTER_SITES` 中有 20 个站点；这些站点慢得要命，所有站点都提供 [.filename]#beta#，而 [.filename]#alpha# 只有第 20 个站点提供。如果维护者事先知道这一点，还逐一检查所有站点岂不是太浪费时间？这可不是度过美好周末的好开端！"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2214
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the concept is clear, just imagine more `DISTFILES` and more "
"`MASTER_SITES`.  Surely our \"distfiles survey meister\" would appreciate "
"the relief to network strain that this would bring."
msgstr "概念清楚之后，再想象一下有更多的 `DISTFILES` 和更多的 `MASTER_SITES`。我们的“发行文件调查大师”一定会乐于看到这种机制减轻网络负载。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2217
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the next sections, information will follow on the FreeBSD implementation "
"of this idea.  We improved a bit on OpenBSD's concept."
msgstr "接下来的章节将介绍 FreeBSD 对这一理念的实现。我们对 OpenBSD 的概念做了一些改进。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2222
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The group names cannot have dashes in them (`-`), in fact, they cannot have "
"any characters out of the `[a-zA-Z0-9_]` range.  This is because, while man:"
"make[1] is ok with variable names containing dashes, man:sh[1] is not."
msgstr "分组名称不能包含连字符（`-`），事实上也不能包含 `[a-zA-Z0-9_]` 范围以外的字符。这是因为 man:make[1] 可以接受包含连字符的变量名，而 man:sh[1] 不行。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2225
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Simplified Information"
msgstr "简要说明"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2232
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This section explains how to quickly prepare fine grained fetching of "
"multiple distribution files and patches from different sites and "
"subdirectories.  We describe here a case of simplified `MASTER_SITES:n` "
"usage.  This will be sufficient for most scenarios.  More detailed "
"information are available in crossref:makefiles[ports-master-sites-n-"
"detailed, Detailed Information]."
msgstr "本节介绍如何快速配置从不同站点和子目录精确获取多个发行文件和补丁。这里介绍 `MASTER_SITES:n` 的简化用法，足以应对大多数情况。更多详细信息请参见 crossref:makefiles[ports-master-sites-n-detailed,详细说明]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2236
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some applications consist of multiple distribution files that must be "
"downloaded from a number of different sites.  For example, Ghostscript "
"consists of the core of the program, and then a large number of driver files "
"that are used depending on the user's printer.  Some of these driver files "
"are supplied with the core, but many others must be downloaded from a "
"variety of different sites."
msgstr "有些应用程序由多个发行文件组成，必须从多个不同站点下载。例如，Ghostscript 包含程序核心，以及大量驱动程序文件，具体使用哪些驱动程序取决于用户的打印机。其中一些驱动程序文件随核心一起提供，但许多其他文件必须从不同站点下载。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2239
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To support this, each entry in `DISTFILES` may be followed by a colon and a "
"\"group name\".  Each site listed in `MASTER_SITES` is then followed by a "
"colon, and the group that indicates which distribution files are downloaded "
"from this site."
msgstr "为支持这一点，可以在 `DISTFILES` 的每个条目后面加上冒号和“分组名称”。`MASTER_SITES` 中列出的每个站点后面也加上冒号，并指定一个分组，用来表示从该站点下载哪些发行文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2243
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For example, consider an application with the source split in two parts, [."
"filename]#source1.tar.gz# and [.filename]#source2.tar.gz#, which must be "
"downloaded from two different sites.  The port's [.filename]#Makefile# would "
"include lines like crossref:makefiles[ports-master-sites-n-example-simple-"
"use-one-file-per-site,Simplified Use of `MASTER_SITES:n` with One File Per "
"Site]."
msgstr "例如，假设某个应用程序的源代码分为两部分：[.filename]#source1.tar.gz# 和 [.filename]#source2.tar.gz#，必须从两个不同站点下载。该 Port 的 [.filename]#Makefile# 中应包含类似 crossref:makefiles[ports-master-sites-n-example-simple-use-one-file-per-site,每个站点一个文件的 `MASTER_SITES:n` 简化用法] 的行。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2245
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Simplified Use of `MASTER_SITES:n` with One File Per Site"
msgstr "每个站点一个文件的 `MASTER_SITES:n` 简化用法"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2255
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"MASTER_SITES=\tftp://ftp1.example.com/:source1 \\\n"
"\t\thttp://www.example.com/:source2\n"
"DISTFILES=\tsource1.tar.gz:source1 \\\n"
"\t\tsource2.tar.gz:source2\n"
msgstr "MASTER_SITES=\tftp://ftp1.example.com/:source1 \\\n\t\thttp://www.example.com/:source2\nDISTFILES=\tsource1.tar.gz:source1 \\\n\t\tsource2.tar.gz:source2\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2263
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Multiple distribution files can have the same group.  Continuing the "
"previous example, suppose that there was a third distfile, [."
"filename]#source3.tar.gz#, that is downloaded from `www.example.com`.  The [."
"filename]#Makefile# would then be written like crossref:makefiles[ports-"
"master-sites-n-example-simple-use-more-than-one-file-per-site,Simplified Use "
"of `MASTER_SITES:n` with More Than One File Per Site]."
msgstr "多个发行文件可以属于同一分组。继续前面的示例，假设还有第三个发行文件 [.filename]#source3.tar.gz#，从 `www.example.com` 下载。那么 [.filename]#Makefile# 应按 crossref:makefiles[ports-master-sites-n-example-simple-use-more-than-one-file-per-site,每个站点多个文件的 `MASTER_SITES:n` 简化用法] 编写。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2265
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Simplified Use of `MASTER_SITES:n` with More Than One File Per Site"
msgstr "每个站点多个文件的 `MASTER_SITES:n` 简化用法"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2276
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"MASTER_SITES=\tftp://ftp.example.com/:source1 \\\n"
"\t\thttp://www.example.com/:source2\n"
"DISTFILES=\tsource1.tar.gz:source1 \\\n"
"\t\tsource2.tar.gz:source2 \\\n"
"\t\tsource3.tar.gz:source2\n"
msgstr "MASTER_SITES=\tftp://ftp.example.com/:source1 \\\n\t\thttp://www.example.com/:source2\nDISTFILES=\tsource1.tar.gz:source1 \\\n\t\tsource2.tar.gz:source2 \\\n\t\tsource3.tar.gz:source2\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2281
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Detailed Information"
msgstr "详细说明"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2284
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Okay, so the previous example did not reflect the new port's needs? In this "
"section we will explain in detail how the fine grained fetching mechanism "
"`MASTER_SITES:n` works and how it can be used."
msgstr "好吧，前面的示例可能并不符合新 Port 的需求。本节将详细说明精确获取机制 `MASTER_SITES:n` 的工作原理及其用法。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2286
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Elements can be postfixed with `:__n__` where _n_ is `[^:,]\\+`, that is, "
"_n_ could conceptually be any alphanumeric string but we will limit it to "
"`[a-zA-Z_][0-9a-zA-Z_]+` for now."
msgstr "元素后面可以附加 `:__n__`，其中 __n__ 是 `[^:,]\\+`，也就是说，从概念上讲，__n__ 可以是任意字母数字字符串，但目前我们将其限制为 `[a-zA-Z_][0-9a-zA-Z_]+`。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2288
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Moreover, string matching is case sensitive; that is, `n` is different from "
"`N`."
msgstr "此外，字符串匹配区分大小写；也就是说，`n` 与 `N` 不同。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2294
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"However, these words cannot be used for postfixing purposes since they yield "
"special meaning: `default`, `all` and `ALL` (they are used internally in "
"item crossref:makefiles[porting-master-sites-n-what-changes-in-port-targets, "
"ii]).  Furthermore, `DEFAULT` is a special purpose word (check item crossref:"
"makefiles[porting-master-sites-n-DEFAULT-group,3])."
msgstr "但是，这些单词不能用于后缀，因为它们具有特殊含义：`default`、`all` 和 `ALL`（它们在条目 crossref:makefiles[porting-master-sites-n-what-changes-in-port-targets,ii] 中内部使用）。此外，`DEFAULT` 也是一个特殊用途的单词（参见条目 crossref:makefiles[porting-master-sites-n-DEFAULT-group,3]）。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:2295
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
