#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3155
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Redistribution of the distribution files is permitted.  The distribution "
"files will be added to the FreeBSD `MASTER_SITE_BACKUP` CDN."
msgstr "允许重新分发发行文件。发行文件将添加到 FreeBSD `MASTER_SITE_BACKUP` CDN。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3157
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`no-dist-mirror`"
msgstr "`no-dist-mirror`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3161
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Redistribution of the distribution files is prohibited.  This is equivalent "
"to setting crossref:special[porting-restrictions-restricted,`RESTRICTED`].  "
"The distribution files will _not_ be added to the FreeBSD "
"`MASTER_SITE_BACKUP` CDN."
msgstr "禁止重新分发发行文件。这等同于设置 crossref:special[porting-restrictions-restricted,`RESTRICTED`]。发行文件__不会__添加到 FreeBSD `MASTER_SITE_BACKUP` CDN。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3163
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`dist-sell`"
msgstr "`dist-sell`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3166
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Selling of distribution files is permitted.  The distribution files will be "
"present on the installer images."
msgstr "允许销售发行文件。发行文件将包含在安装映像中。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3168
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`no-dist-sell`"
msgstr "`no-dist-sell`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3171
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Selling of distribution files is prohibited.  This is equivalent to setting "
"crossref:special[porting-restrictions-no_cdrom,`NO_CDROM`]."
msgstr "禁止销售发行文件。这等同于设置 crossref:special[porting-restrictions-no_cdrom,`NO_CDROM`]。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3173
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`pkg-mirror`"
msgstr "`pkg-mirror`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3176
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Free redistribution of package is permitted.  The package will be "
"distributed on the FreeBSD package CDN https://pkg.freebsd.org/[https://pkg."
"freebsd.org/]."
msgstr "允许免费重新分发软件包。软件包将在 FreeBSD 软件包 CDN link:https://pkg.freebsd.org/[https://pkg.freebsd.org/] 上分发。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3178
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`no-pkg-mirror`"
msgstr "`no-pkg-mirror`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3182
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Free redistribution of package is prohibited.  Equivalent to setting "
"crossref:special[porting-restrictions-no_package,`NO_PACKAGE`].  The package "
"will _not_ be distributed from the FreeBSD package CDN https://pkg.freebsd."
"org/[https://pkg.freebsd.org/]."
msgstr "禁止免费重新分发软件包。这等同于设置 crossref:special[porting-restrictions-no_package,`NO_PACKAGE`]。软件包__不会__从 FreeBSD 软件包 CDN link:https://pkg.freebsd.org/[https://pkg.freebsd.org/] 分发。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3184
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`pkg-sell`"
msgstr "`pkg-sell`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3187
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Selling of package is permitted.  The package will be present on the "
"installer images."
msgstr "允许销售软件包。软件包将包含在安装映像中。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3189
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`no-pkg-sell`"
msgstr "`no-pkg-sell`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3193
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Selling of package is prohibited.  This is equivalent to setting crossref:"
"special[porting-restrictions-no_cdrom,`NO_CDROM`].  The package will _not_ "
"be present on the installer images."
msgstr "禁止销售软件包。这等同于设置 crossref:special[porting-restrictions-no_cdrom,`NO_CDROM`]。软件包__不会__包含在安装映像中。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3195
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`auto-accept`"
msgstr "`auto-accept`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3199
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"License is accepted by default.  Prompts to accept a license are not "
"displayed unless the user has defined `LICENSES_ASK`.  Use this unless the "
"license states the user must accept the terms of the license."
msgstr "默认接受许可证。除非用户定义了 `LICENSES_ASK`，否则不会显示接受许可证的提示。除非许可证规定用户必须接受其条款，否则请使用此权限。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3201
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`no-auto-accept`"
msgstr "`no-auto-accept`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3205
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"License is not accepted by default.  The user will always be asked to "
"confirm the acceptance of this license.  This must be used if the license "
"states that the user must accept its terms."
msgstr "默认不接受许可证。系统始终会要求用户确认是否接受此许可证。如果许可证规定用户必须接受其条款，则必须使用此权限。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3207
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When both `_permission_` and `no-_permission_` is present the `no-"
"_permission_` will cancel `_permission_`."
msgstr "如果同时存在 `_permission_` 和 `no-_permission_`，则 `no-_permission_` 会取消 `_permission_`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3209
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When `_permission_` is not present, it is considered to be a `no-"
"_permission_`."
msgstr "如果不存在 `_permission_`，则视为存在 `no-_permission_`。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3213
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some missing permissions will prevent a port (and all ports depending on it) "
"from being usable by package users:"
msgstr "缺少某些权限会导致软件移植（以及所有依赖它的软件移植）无法供软件包用户使用："

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3215
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A port without the `auto-accept` permission will never be built and all the "
"ports depending on it will be ignored."
msgstr "没有 `auto-accept` 权限的软件移植永远不会被构建，所有依赖它的软件移植都将被忽略。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3217
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A port without the `pkg-mirror` permission, and any ports that depend on it, "
"will be removed after the build, thus ensuring they are not distributed."
msgstr "没有 `pkg-mirror` 权限的软件移植及其所有依赖项将在构建后被移除，以确保它们不会被分发。"

