"perl,Using Perl].  X11 variables are listed in crossref:special[using-x11,"
"Using X11].  crossref:special[using-gnome,Using Gnome] deals with GNOME and "
"crossref:special[using-kde,Using KDE] with KDE related variables.  crossref:"
"special[using-java,Using Java] documents Java variables, while crossref:"
"special[using-php,\"Web Applications, Apache and PHP\"] contains information "
"on Apache, PHP and PEAR modules.  Python is discussed in crossref:"
"special[using-python,Using Python], while Ruby in crossref:uses[uses-ruby,"
"Ruby].  crossref:special[using-sdl,Using SDL] provides variables used for "
"SDL applications and finally, crossref:special[using-xfce,Using Xfce] "
"contains information on Xfce."
msgstr "与 gmake 和 [.filename]#configure# 相关的变量见 crossref:special[building,构建机制]；autoconf、automake 和 libtool 见 crossref:special[using-autotools,使用 GNU Autotools]。与 Perl 相关的变量见 crossref:special[using-perl,使用 Perl]。X11 变量列于 crossref:special[using-x11,使用 X11]。crossref:special[using-gnome,使用 Gnome] 介绍 GNOME，crossref:special[using-kde,使用 KDE] 介绍与 KDE 相关的变量。crossref:special[using-java,使用 Java] 介绍 Java 变量；crossref:special[using-php,\"Web 应用程序、Apache 和 PHP\"] 则包含有关 Apache、PHP 和 PEAR 模块的信息。Python 见 crossref:special[using-python,使用 Python]，Ruby 见 crossref:uses[uses-ruby,Ruby]。crossref:special[using-sdl,使用 SDL] 提供 SDL 应用程序所用的变量；最后，crossref:special[using-xfce,使用 Xfce] 包含有关 Xfce 的信息。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3722
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Minimal Version of a Dependency"
msgstr "依赖项的最低版本"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3725
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A minimal version of a dependency can be specified in any `*_DEPENDS` except "
"`LIB_DEPENDS` using this syntax:"
msgstr "除 `LIB_DEPENDS` 外，任何 `*_DEPENDS` 都可以使用以下语法指定依赖项的最低版本："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3729
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "p5-Spiffy>=0.26:devel/p5-Spiffy\n"
msgstr "p5-Spiffy>=0.26:devel/p5-Spiffy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:3733
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The first field contains a dependent package name, which must match the "
"entry in the package database, a comparison sign, and a package version.  "
"The dependency is satisfied if p5-Spiffy-0.26 or newer is installed on the "
