#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4266
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`OPT_USE` and `OPT_USE_OFF`"
msgstr "`OPT_USE` 和 `OPT_USE_OFF`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4272
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When option _OPT_ is selected, for each `_key=value_` pair in ``OPT_USE``, "
"_value_ is appended to the corresponding `USE_KEY`.  If _value_ has spaces "
"in it, replace them with commas and they will be changed back to spaces "
"during processing.  `OPT_USE_OFF` works the same way, but when `OPT` is "
"_not_ selected.  For example:"
msgstr "选择选项 __OPT__ 时，对于 ``OPT_USE`` 中的每个 `_key=value_` 键值对，都会将 _value_ 附加到相应的 `USE_KEY`。如果 _value_ 中包含空格，请将空格替换为逗号；处理时会将逗号还原为空格。`OPT_USE_OFF` 的工作方式相同，但适用于未选择 `OPT` 的情况。例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4279
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"OPTIONS_DEFINE=\tOPT1\n"
"OPT1_USES=\txorg\n"
"OPT1_USE=\tmysql=yes xorg=x11,xextproto,xext,xrandr\n"
"OPT1_USE_OFF=\topenssl=yes\n"
msgstr "OPTIONS_DEFINE=\tOPT1\nOPT1_USES=\txorg\nOPT1_USE=\tmysql=yes xorg=x11,xextproto,xext,xrandr\nOPT1_USE_OFF=\topenssl=yes\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4296
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
".if ${PORT_OPTIONS:MOPT1}\n"
"USE_MYSQL=\tyes\n"
"USES+=\t\txorg\n"
"USE_XORG=\tx11 xextproto xext xrandr\n"
".else\n"
"USE_OPENSSL=\tyes\n"
".endif\n"
msgstr ".if ${PORT_OPTIONS:MOPT1}\nUSE_MYSQL=\tyes\nUSES+=\t\txorg\nUSE_XORG=\tx11 xextproto xext xrandr\n.else\nUSE_OPENSSL=\tyes\n.endif\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4299
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`CONFIGURE_ARGS` Helpers"
msgstr "`CONFIGURE_ARGS` 辅助项"

#. type: Title =====
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4302
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`OPT_CONFIGURE_ENABLE`"
msgstr "`OPT_CONFIGURE_ENABLE`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4309
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When option _OPT_ is selected, for each _entry_ in `OPT_CONFIGURE_ENABLE` "
"then `--enable-_entry_` is appended to `CONFIGURE_ARGS`.  When option _OPT_ "
"is _not_ selected, `--disable-_entry_` is appended to `CONFIGURE_ARGS`.  An "
"optional argument can be specified with an `=` symbol.  This argument is "
"only appended to the `--enable-_entry_` configure option.  For example:"
msgstr "选择选项 __OPT__ 时，`OPT_CONFIGURE_ENABLE` 中的每个 _entry_ 都会使 `--enable-_entry_` 附加到 `CONFIGURE_ARGS`。未选择选项 __OPT__ 时，则会附加 `--disable-_entry_`。可以使用 `=` 符号指定可选参数。此参数只会附加到 `--enable-_entry_` configure 选项。例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4315
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"OPTIONS_DEFINE=\tOPT1 OPT2\n"
"OPT1_CONFIGURE_ENABLE=\ttest1 test2\n"
"OPT2_CONFIGURE_ENABLE=\ttest2=exhaustive\n"
msgstr "OPTIONS_DEFINE=\tOPT1 OPT2\nOPT1_CONFIGURE_ENABLE=\ttest1 test2\nOPT2_CONFIGURE_ENABLE=\ttest2=exhaustive\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4330
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
".if ${PORT_OPTIONS:MOPT1}\n"
"CONFIGURE_ARGS+=\t--enable-test1 --enable-test2\n"
".else\n"
"CONFIGURE_ARGS+=\t--disable-test1 --disable-test2\n"
".endif\n"
msgstr ".if ${PORT_OPTIONS:MOPT1}\nCONFIGURE_ARGS+=\t--enable-test1 --enable-test2\n.else\nCONFIGURE_ARGS+=\t--disable-test1 --disable-test2\n.endif\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4336
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
".if ${PORT_OPTIONS:MOPT2}\n"
"CONFIGURE_ARGS+=\t--enable-test2=exhaustive\n"
".else\n"
"CONFIGURE_ARGS+=\t--disable-test2\n"
".endif\n"
msgstr ".if ${PORT_OPTIONS:MOPT2}\nCONFIGURE_ARGS+=\t--enable-test2=exhaustive\n.else\nCONFIGURE_ARGS+=\t--disable-test2\n.endif\n"

#. type: Title =====
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4339
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`OPT_CONFIGURE_WITH`"
msgstr "`OPT_CONFIGURE_WITH`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4346
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When option _OPT_ is selected, for each _entry_ in `OPT_CONFIGURE_WITH` then "
"`--with-_entry_` is appended to `CONFIGURE_ARGS`.  When option _OPT_ is "
"_not_ selected, `--without-_entry_` is appended to `CONFIGURE_ARGS`.  An "
"optional argument can be specified with an `=` symbol.  This argument is "
"only appended to the `--with-_entry_` configure option.  For example:"
msgstr "选择选项 __OPT__ 时，`OPT_CONFIGURE_WITH` 中的每个 _entry_ 都会使 `--with-_entry_` 附加到 `CONFIGURE_ARGS`。未选择选项 __OPT__ 时，则会附加 `--without-_entry_`。可以使用 `=` 符号指定可选参数。此参数只会附加到 `--with-_entry_` configure 选项。例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/_index.adoc:4352
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"OPTIONS_DEFINE=\tOPT1 OPT2\n"
